but at the moment, for the last five minutes before we get the camera ready, I am just

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:02.240
doing a super cool to make sure that they don't fly away immediately.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:09.480
The final stage, just getting to that point where they are so docile that I can literally

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:13.640
